  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Queries the status of a token. If token-based authentication is used for permission authentication on an ApsaraMQ for MQTT broker, a token that is issued by the broker is required for authentication each time a client is connected to the broker. A token is a temporary credential and is valid only within a specific period of time. You can call this operation to query whether a token expires",
  "description_zh": "Token鉴权方式下，云消息队列 MQTT 版服务端会颁发Token（临时凭证）给客户端，客户端访问云消息队列 MQTT 版服务端时需要携带Token用于权限验证。\nToken为临时访问凭证具有一定的时效性，您可以通过本接口查询Token是否失效",
